losed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"nocaway","id":31016169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDE2MTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31016169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway","html_url":"https://github.com/nocaway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"nocaway","id":31016169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDE2MTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31016169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway","html_url":"https://github.com/nocaway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2019-12-19T03:36:30Z","updated_at":"2020-01-03T06:21:54Z","closed_at":"2020-01-03T06:21:54Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"[EDIT: Issue applies to transactional indexes also.]\r\n\r\nConsider a table with a non-transactional index create on 1.3.0.0\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE blocks (\r\n    k int PRIMARY KEY,\r\n    time int,\r\n    height bigint\r\n) WITH transactions = {'enabled': 'false'};\r\n\r\nCREATE INDEX blocks_height ON blocks (height, k)\r\n   WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (k ASC)\r\n   AND transactions = {'enabled': 'false', 'consistency_level': 'user_enforced'};\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe query plan is as one would expect:\r\n```\r\ncqlsh> explain select * from blocks where height = 1 limit 1;\r\n QUERY PLAN\r\n----------------------------------------------\r\n Index Scan using k.blocks_height on k.blocks\r\n   Key Conditions: (height = 1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter upgrading the DB to a 2.0.5.2, the query plan is no longer using the index, but ends up doing a full scan:\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:k> explain select * from blocks where height = 1 limit 1;\r\n QUERY PLAN\r\n------------------------------\r\n Limit\r\n   ->  Seq Scan on k.blocks\r\n         Filter: (height = 1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, if the table & index are created from the start on 2.0.5.2 -- then that case does not suffer from the issue. \r\n\r\nThe issue seems specific to upgrade path.","closed_by":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk","html_url":"https://github.com/kmuthukk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.g